{"audio": "john-10.opus", "duration_ms": 271656, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 2080, "end_ms": 3200, "text": "John, Chapter Ten."}, {"start_ms": 4880, "end_ms": 12481, "text": "“Truly, truly, I tell you, whoever does not enter the sheepfold by the gate, but climbs in some other way, is a thief and a robber."}, {"start_ms": 13121, "end_ms": 16121, "text": "But the one who enters by the gate is the shepherd of the sheep."}, {"start_ms": 16881, "end_ms": 20841, "text": "The gatekeeper opens the gate for him, and the sheep listen for his voice."}, {"start_ms": 21301, "end_ms": 24141, "text": "He calls his own sheep by name and leads them out."}, {"start_ms": 24981, "end_ms": 31062, "text": "When he has brought out all his own, he goes on ahead of them, and his sheep follow him because they know his voice."}, {"start_ms": 31762, "end_ms": 43523, "text": "But they will never follow a stranger; in fact, they will flee from him because they do not recognize his voice.” Jesus spoke to them using this illustration, but they did not understand what He was telling them."}, {"start_ms": 44283, "end_ms": 49103, "text": "So He said to them again, “Truly, truly, I tell you, I am the gate for the sheep."}, {"start_ms": 49623, "end_ms": 54323, "text": "All who came before Me were thieves and robbers, but the sheep did not listen to them."}, {"start_ms": 55123, "end_ms": 55743, "text": "I am the gate."}, {"start_ms": 56063, "end_ms": 58563, "text": "If anyone enters through Me, he will be saved."}, {"start_ms": 58943, "end_ms": 61584, "text": "He will come in and go out and find pasture."}, {"start_ms": 62264, "end_ms": 65424, "text": "The thief comes only to steal and kill and destroy."}, {"start_ms": 66184, "end_ms": 69624, "text": "I have come that they may have life, and have it in all its fullness."}, {"start_ms": 70604, "end_ms": 71484, "text": "I am the good shepherd."}, {"start_ms": 71864, "end_ms": 74064, "text": "The good shepherd lays down His life for the sheep."}, {"start_ms": 74564, "end_ms": 78125, "text": "The hired hand is not the shepherd, and the sheep are not his own."}, {"start_ms": 78725, "end_ms": 82105, "text": "When he sees the wolf coming, he abandons the sheep and runs away."}, {"start_ms": 82925, "end_ms": 85525, "text": "Then the wolf pounces on them and scatters the flock."}, {"start_ms": 86305, "end_ms": 91105, "text": "The man runs away because he is a hired servant and is unconcerned for the sheep."}, {"start_ms": 92125, "end_ms": 93125, "text": "I am the good shepherd."}, {"start_ms": 93486, "end_ms": 98746, "text": "I know My sheep and My sheep know Me, just as the Father knows Me and I know the Father."}, {"start_ms": 99406, "end_ms": 101306, "text": "And I lay down My life for the sheep."}, {"start_ms": 102326, "end_ms": 104246, "text": "I have other sheep that are not of this fold."}, {"start_ms": 104686, "end_ms": 107806, "text": "I must bring them in as well, and they will listen to My voice."}, {"start_ms": 108366, "end_ms": 111167, "text": "Then there will be one flock and one shepherd."}, {"start_ms": 112407, "end_ms": 117007, "text": "The reason the Father loves Me is that I lay down My life in order to take it up again."}, {"start_ms": 117687, "end_ms": 121107, "text": "No one takes it from Me, but I lay it down of My own accord."}, {"start_ms": 121847, "end_ms": 125147, "text": "I have authority to lay it down and authority to take it up again."}, {"start_ms": 125747, "end_ms": 132488, "text": "This charge I have received from My Father.” Again there was division among the Jews because of Jesus’ message."}, {"start_ms": 133148, "end_ms": 136368, "text": "Many of them said, “He is demon-possessed and insane."}, {"start_ms": 136608, "end_ms": 142788, "text": "Why would you listen to Him?” But others replied, “These are not the words of a man possessed by a demon."}, {"start_ms": 143128, "end_ms": 149969, "text": "Can a demon open the eyes of the blind?” At that time the Feast of Dedication took place in Jerusalem."}, {"start_ms": 150489, "end_ms": 155189, "text": "It was winter, and Jesus was walking in the temple courts in Solomon’s Colonnade."}, {"start_ms": 155889, "end_ms": 161029, "text": "So the Jews gathered around Him and demanded, “How long will You keep us in suspense?"}, {"start_ms": 161510, "end_ms": 168330, "text": "If You are the Christ, tell us plainly.” “I already told you,” Jesus replied, “but you did not believe."}, {"start_ms": 168810, "end_ms": 172010, "text": "The works I do in My Father’s name testify on My behalf."}, {"start_ms": 172590, "end_ms": 175650, "text": "But because you are not My sheep, you refuse to believe."}, {"start_ms": 176310, "end_ms": 179791, "text": "My sheep listen to My voice; I know them, and they follow Me."}, {"start_ms": 180411, "end_ms": 182911, "text": "I give them eternal life, and they will never perish."}, {"start_ms": 183511, "end_ms": 185671, "text": "No one can snatch them out of My hand."}, {"start_ms": 186231, "end_ms": 189051, "text": "My Father who has given them to Me is greater than all."}, {"start_ms": 189591, "end_ms": 192071, "text": "No one can snatch them out of My Father’s hand."}, {"start_ms": 192811, "end_ms": 198352, "text": "I and the Father are one.” At this, the Jews again picked up stones to stone Him."}, {"start_ms": 198892, "end_ms": 202832, "text": "But Jesus responded, “I have shown you many good works from the Father."}, {"start_ms": 203112, "end_ms": 218593, "text": "For which of these do you stone Me?” “We are not stoning You for any good work,” said the Jews, “but for blasphemy, because You, who are a man, make Yourself out to be God.” Jesus replied, “Is it not written in your Law: ‘I have said you are gods’?"}, {"start_ms": 219133, "end_ms": 228133, "text": "If he called them gods to whom the word of God came—and the Scripture cannot be broken— then what about the One whom the Father sanctified and sent into the world?"}, {"start_ms": 228753, "end_ms": 232934, "text": "How then can you accuse Me of blasphemy for stating that I am the Son of God?"}, {"start_ms": 233834, "end_ms": 237174, "text": "If I am not doing the works of My Father, then do not believe Me."}, {"start_ms": 237754, "end_ms": 252415, "text": "But if I am doing them, even though you do not believe Me, believe the works themselves, so that you may know and understand that the Father is in Me, and I am in the Father.” At this, they tried again to seize Him, but He escaped their grasp."}, {"start_ms": 253695, "end_ms": 259415, "text": "Then Jesus went back across the Jordan to the place where John had first been baptizing, and He stayed there."}, {"start_ms": 260275, "end_ms": 269536, "text": "Many came to Him and said, “Although John never performed a sign, everything he said about this man was true.” And many in that place believed in Jesus."}], "words": [{"t": "John,", "s": 2080, "e": 2360, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2580, "e": 2900, "si": 0}, {"t": "Ten.", "s": 2980, "e": 3200, "si": 0}, {"t": "“Truly,", "s": 4880, "e": 5220, "si": 1}, {"t": "truly,", "s": 5340, "e": 5640, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 5780, "e": 5800, "si": 1}, {"t": "tell", "s": 5860, "e": 6060, "si": 1}, {"t": "you,", "s": 6100, "e": 6220, "si": 1}, {"t": "whoever", "s": 6500, "e": 6860, "si": 1}, {"t": "does", "s": 6920, "e": 7100, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 7160, "e": 7360, "si": 1}, {"t": "enter", "s": 7500, "e": 7720, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 7760, "e": 7840, "si": 1}, {"t": "sheepfold", "s": 7880, "e": 8380, "si": 1}, {"t": "by", "s": 8440, "e": 8561, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 8581, "e": 8661, "si": 1}, {"t": "gate,", "s": 8721, "e": 9021, "si": 1}, {"t": "but", "s": 9121, "e": 9241, "si": 1}, {"t": "climbs", "s": 9321, "e": 9741, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 9801, "e": 9921, "si": 1}, {"t": "some", "s": 10061, "e": 10221, "si": 1}, {"t": "other", "s": 10241, "e": 10401, "si": 1}, {"t": "way,", "s": 10461, "e": 10661, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 11181, "e": 11281, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 11341, 